Description: Programming language with first-class VM and C transpiler
 rl-lang is a modern programming language featuring a bytecode VM and
 C transpilation. It includes a REPL, language server, and standard
 library.
 .
 This package contains rl, rlc, rlt, rlrepl, rlsp, rldocs, rlm,
 and related tools.
